# The SQLite database is a local working artifact, not the record. Git cannot
# diff or merge a binary blob, so committing it would give an unreviewable
# history and unresolvable conflicts across machines.
#
# The durable, version-controlled record is bets.csv / odds_snapshots.csv,
# written by `tools/history.py export` and read back by `... import`.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
